### 4. Quick Interview Cheat Sheet (Key Buzzwords to Highlight)

* **"Immutable Artifacts":** Build once, deploy the exact same SHA-tagged Docker image across Dev, Staging, and Prod.
* **"Shift-Left Security":** Catching secrets, code vulnerabilities (SAST), and container CVEs (Trivy) *before* deployment.
* **"Least Privilege / OIDC":** Using GitHub OIDC with AWS IAM Roles instead of storing long-lived `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID` secrets in CI.
* **"Self-Healing & Drift Detection":** Explaining how ArgoCD prevents manual `kubectl edit` drift in production.
